我用现存 `results/seurat_miqc_doublet_optimized` 结果看了一下 mt 分布：

| sample | median mt | q95 mt | pct mt > 15% | miQC removed |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| lpr-1 | 2.66% | 18.74% | 6.31% | 6270 |
| lpr-4 | 3.31% | 16.37% | 5.81% | 5629 |
| lpr-5 | 0.84% | 6.47% | 2.53% | 2384 |
| mpj-1 | 3.67% | 31.66% | 10.59% | 2625 |
