我建议最终规则改成这样：

```text
核心通过条件：
1. component_mean_mt_gap >= 3%
2. nFeature_drop_fraction >= 10%
3. posterior_uncertain_fraction < 20%
4. miQC_removed_fraction <= 40%
5. removed_median_mt_gap >= 3%
6. removed_median_nFeature_ratio <= 0.75

增强复核条件：
1. mt_q95 < 10% but mt_q99 >= 20%
2. mt_q95 < 10% but frac_mt_gt15 >= 1%
3. compromised_component_fraction < 1%
4. miQC_removed_fraction > 20% in otherwise low-tail sample

决策：
- 核心条件都过：用 miQC
- 核心条件不过：fallback MAD
- 核心条件过但触发复核条件：用 miQC，但 review_needed
```

对这批数据，`lpr-5` 大概率会变成：

```text
selected_filter = miQC
review_needed = TRUE
reason = mt_q95_low_but_q99_high_and_miqc_separates_low_feature_tail
```

这比简单地把它丢给 MAD 更合理。

